            "text": "The panels below show the D shape: in the key of D it is the open D chord you know. Play the chord, then its arpeggio from the lowest {{1}} to the highest.\nThen move it up the neck. Use the Key selector below to change the key.\nWhen you change the key, the shape keeps its outline, and finger 1 frets the note the open D string gave you."
